                        :scopeNote "HfO2-family only. Perovskite, multiferroic and hydrogen-bond ferroelectrics are excluded by design, not absent for lack of evidence. The class keeps its general name so scope can widen later without a rename." ,
                                   "Not disjoint: HfO2 is dielectric in one stack position and ferroelectric in another depending on phase." ;
                        :sourceLocator "S1{I B}" ;
                        rdfs:comment "Every subclass is HfO2-family. Perovskite and other non-HfO2 ferroelectrics are out of scope by design, not absent for lack of evidence." ;
                        rdfs:label "Ferroelectric Material" .


